WEBVTT

00:15:29.496 --> 00:15:34.204
So you mention that a lot of chimps
are able to gain alpha status

00:15:34.204 --> 00:15:37.079
and essentially elicit submissiveness,

00:15:37.829 --> 00:15:41.621
but they're not necessarily admired
or willingly followed.

00:15:42.246 --> 00:15:47.037
Does that mean that the dominant alpha
males actually lose their status faster,

00:15:47.412 --> 00:15:50.412
whereas the the ones that either
use their intelligence

00:15:50.412 --> 00:15:55.204
or other strategies are more likely to
sustain the respective of a group?

00:15:56.162 --> 00:15:59.496
They are aggressive. One
last that long usually.